{"id": "e13117", "jo": "j02945", "contract": "(간편)[삭감없음용]허혈심장질환진단특약(무배당, 갱신형)", "members": ["e13116", "e13117", "e13118"], "text": "제2-2조 보험금의 지급사유\n회사는 특약보험기간 중 피보험자가 \"허혈심장질환\"으로 진단확정 되었을 경우에는 보험수익자에게 약정한 허혈심장질환진단급여금(<부표2-1> \"보\nThe main feature of the system is that it can be used to calculate the energy of a molecule. The energy of a molecule is the sum of the kinetic energy of all the particles in the molecule. The kinetic energy of a particle is given by the formula $E = \\frac{1}{2} m v^2$, where $m$ is the mass of the particle and $v$ is its velocity. In the case of a molecule, the kinetic energy is the sum of the kinetic energies of all the atoms in the molecule. The kinetic energy of an atom is given by the formula $E = \\frac{1}{2} m v^2$, where $m$ is the mass of the atom and $v$ is its velocity. Therefore, the total kinetic energy of a molecule is the sum of the kinetic energies of all the atoms in the molecule.\n험금 지급기준표\" 참조)을 지급합니다.(다만, 최초 1회의 진단확정에 한함)", "read_calls_left": 31}
